      "message": "@fmalita - thanks for the feedback - I appreciate it!\n/cc @thestig - WDYT?  (you proposed `SkVectorWStream` in https://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/c/pdfium/+/136570/comment/dc50b41b_b5ec9e24/;  the linked bug points out the Chromium copy of that code).",
